  "description": "## What's New in v4.6.1\n\n### Streaming Error Content\n- `StreamingContent.Content` now contains descriptive error message (`API error ({statusCode}): {error}`) across all providers\n- Previously `Content` was null on error — now enables reliable client-side error handling\n- Affected: Claude, ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Gemini, Grok, Sonar\n\n### Claude Fixes\n- Corrected `opus-4-6` max output tokens: 131072 → 128000\n- `ApplyThinkingConfig` auto-adjusts `max_tokens` when `budget_tokens >= max_tokens` (Claude API requirement)\n\n### Tests\n- `ClaudeThinkingBudgetAutoAdjustTest` — verifies budget auto-adjust logic\n- `ReasoningStreamingTest` — reasoning streaming with early error detection\n\n## Supported Models\n\n### OpenAI\n- GPT-5, GPT-5 Mini, GPT-5 Nano, GPT-5 Chat Latest\n- GPT-5.1\n- GPT-5.2, GPT-5.2 Pro, GPT-5.2 Codex\n- o3, o3-pro\n- GPT-4.1, GPT-4.1 Mini, GPT-4.1 Nano\n- GPT-4o, GPT-4o Mini, GPT-4 Vision\n\n### Anthropic Claude\n- Claude Opus 4.6, Opus 4.5, Opus 4.1, Opus 4\n- Claude Sonnet 4.6, Sonnet 4.5, Sonnet 4\n- Claude Haiku 4.5\n\n### xAI Grok\n- Grok 4, Grok 4.1 Fast\n- Grok 3, Grok 3 Mini\n\n### Google Gemini\n- Gemini 2.5 Pro, Flash, Flash-Lite\n- Gemini 3 Pro Preview, Flash Preview\n\n### DeepSeek\n- DeepSeek Chat, DeepSeek Reasoner\n\n### Perplexity\n- Sonar, Sonar Pro, Sonar Reasoning\n\n## Documentation\n- Basic Usage: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki\n- Advanced Features: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki/Advanced-Features\n- Release Notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki/Release-Notes\n- GitHub: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI",
